<title>UK: NordLB sets $157 million bond due October 1998.</title>
<headline>NordLB sets $157 million bond due October 1998.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Merrill Lynch.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NORDDEUTSCHE LANDESBANK GZ</p>
<p> AMT    $157 MLN	COUPON     6.34	MATURITY    07.OCT.98</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE   S05.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  15 BP     REOFFER    PAR	 SPREAD	=</p>
<p> NOTES	S-SHORT LAST COUPON</p>
